    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Troubleshooting",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 7
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Movie not downloading?**\n\nSearch across all media services:\n\n[Search logs for a title →](/d/homelab-log-workbench?${__url_time_range}&var-service=sonarr&var-service=radarr&var-service=prowlarr&var-service=qbittorrent)\n\nIn the Log Workbench, type the movie/show name in the **Search** box to trace its lifecycle.\n\n**Common causes:**\n- Queue errors → quality restrictions too tight\n- Indexer down → check Indexer Health panel\n- Download speed 0 → VPN issue\n- Stale queue → check qBittorrent"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Bottleneck Investigation",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "id": 301,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU per Service",
      "description": "If Plex/Jellyfin CPU is pinned → transcoding bottleneck. If Sonarr/Radarr CPU spikes → likely processing a large import or search.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource_prometheus}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource_prometheus}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (service) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{host=~\"$host\", service=~\"${media_services}\", name!=\"\", image!=\"\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "gradientMode": "scheme",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic-by-name"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "View Logs →",
              "url": "/d/homelab-log-workbench?${__url_time_range}&var-service=${__field.labels.service}",
              "targetBlank": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        },
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
